Declare rules_multitool's repo rules reproducible so they can use the repo contents cache.

Without this the multitool hub and every tool repo it creates (shellcheck, wasm-bindgen)
are refetched on every CI runner and miss the remote repo contents cache.

This is the upstream fix, applied verbatim:
https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_multitool/pull/123
It merged on 2026-03-10 but the most recent release (v1.11.1) predates it, so there is no
version to bump to. Drop this patch once a release containing it ships.

